@startuml FLOW-07-文件撤权删除传播活动任务停止与残留清理时序图
title 图 FLOW-07 时序图·文件撤权、删除传播、活动任务停止与残留清理时序图
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "用户" as User
participant "客户端 A" as ClientA
control "TaskRunner" as TaskRunner
database "LocalStore" as LocalStore
participant "服务端 sync-service" as Server
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "客户端 B" as ClientB

== 阶段 1：用户触发文件撤权或逻辑删除 ==

User -> ClientA : 点击“撤销授权并移除”或“删除笔记”
ClientA -> ClientA : 阻断新的检索和模型问答请求

== 阶段 2：立即停止运行中任务与本地敏感残留清理 ==

ClientA -> TaskRunner : cancelActiveTasksForDocument(docId)
TaskRunner -> TaskRunner : 发送中断信号 (interrupt / Coroutine.cancel)
TaskRunner --> ClientA : 确认运行中解析/OCR/建索引任务已安全终止

ClientA -> LocalStore : purgeLocalArtifacts(docId)
LocalStore -> LocalStore : 1. 删除本地页面位图与 OCR 缓存
LocalStore -> LocalStore : 2. 删除 BM25 条目与本地向量
LocalStore -> LocalStore : 3. 释放 SAF 持久 URI / 文件句柄
LocalStore -> LocalStore : 4. 状态标记为 DELETED
LocalStore --> ClientA : 本地残留清理完毕

== 阶段 3：生成 Tombstone 并推送服务端 ==

ClientA -> ClientA : 构建不可变删除操作 SyncOperation (isTombstone: true)
ClientA -> Server : HTTPS POST /api/v1/sync/push (UUID-Del-1, baseRev)

Server -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
DB -> DB : 标记逻辑删除 (isDeleted=true)
DB -> DB : 插入待传播墓碑 Tombstones (entityId: docId, expiresAt: Now + N_Days)
DB -> DB : 追加账号变更日志 (Rev-25)
Server -> DB : COMMIT TRANSACTION
Server --> ClientA : HTTP 200 OK (confirmedRev: 25)

== 阶段 4：删除墓碑向客户端 B 传播并执行清理 ==

ClientB -> Server : HTTPS GET /api/v1/sync/pull?cursor=cur_rev24
Server --> ClientB : 返回 Rev-25 (Tombstone: docId 已删除)

ClientB -> ClientB : 识别 Tombstone (严禁静默复活)
ClientB -> TaskRunner : cancelActiveTasksForDocument(docId)
ClientB -> LocalStore : purgeLocalArtifacts(docId)
ClientB -> ClientB : 刷新界面下架文档，保存新游标 cur_rev25
ClientB --> User : 对端静默完成本地残留清理

== 阶段 5：服务端到期异步硬删除与审计清理 ==

Server -> DB : SELECT * FROM Tombstones WHERE expiresAt < Now
DB --> Server : 返回已过期的墓碑记录集合
Server -> DB : 物理清理 UserNotes 与 Tombstones
DB --> Server : 异步硬删除完成，释放空间并记录脱敏审计日志

note over ClientA, Server : 残留清理准则: 本地任务立即中断，多端墓碑传播且严禁静默复活 (D-19, D-26)

@enduml
